= Freikorps are strengthening

Thanks to the growing radicalization to the right and the anti-republican sentiment, sweeping the German Streets, it seems as if the Freikorps have benefited strongly, gaining manpower and even military equippment. This might stem from financing aid from industrials or even ourselfs, or maybe just comes with growing militarization of society... 

Conservatives and Ludendorffists seem rather supportive the Freikorps, with the latter even proposing to integrate them into the army, hoping to profit from them in streetfights against the left. Meanwhile the Reformers around you are lookingat them with cncern, seeing such a politicised enviroment as an obvious sign that military authority and legitimacy is needed more than ever, without untrained Freikorps in their Ranks.

- @concerning: Let's see how this will play out...

@concerning

This does not bode well for the Republic... Maybe we should do something to make sure our Legitimacy isn't thrown out the window by them...
